{
  "$schema": "../../../../packages/shared/schema/animation-scene.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "c-01-builder",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Builder: Adım Adım Kurulum, Tek Doğrulama",
    "en": "Builder: Step-by-Step Assembly, Single Validation"
  },
  "summary": {
    "tr": "İstemci builder üzerinde zincirleme çağrılar yapar; build() doğrular ve değişmez HttpRequest üretir.",
    "en": "The client chains calls on the builder; build() validates and produces an immutable HttpRequest."
  },
  "a11y": {
    "description": {
      "tr": "Solda ApiClient, ortada HttpRequestBuilder ve alanları, sağda üretilecek HttpRequest. İstemci url, header ve timeout çağrılarını zincirler; her çağrı builder'ın iç durumunu doldurur ve kendini döner. build çağrısında builder zorunlu alanları doğrular, değişmez HttpRequest yaratır ve istemciye döner.",
      "en": "ApiClient on the left, HttpRequestBuilder with its fields in the middle, the HttpRequest to be produced on the right. The client chains url, header and timeout calls; each fills the builder's state and returns itself. On build the builder validates required fields, creates an immutable HttpRequest and returns it to the client."
    }
  },
  "canvas": {
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 600
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "client",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "ApiClient",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 150,
      "h": 64,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "fetchOrders()",
        "en": "fetchOrders()"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "builder",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "HttpRequestBuilder",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 260,
      "h": 90,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "url: — · headers: {} · timeout: 30000",
        "en": "url: — · headers: {} · timeout: 30000"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "req",
      "kind": "generic",
      "label": "HttpRequest",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 180,
      "h": 80,
      "sublabel": {
        "tr": "henüz yok",
        "en": "not yet created"
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "cl-b",
      "from": "client",
      "to": "builder",
      "kind": "request",
      "label": ".url().header().timeout()"
    },
    {
      "id": "b-self",
      "from": "builder",
      "to": "builder",
      "kind": "control",
      "label": "return this",
      "style": "dotted",
      "curvature": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "b-req",
      "from": "builder",
      "to": "req",
      "kind": "control",
      "label": "build() → new"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "url",
      "title": {
        "tr": "1. .url(...)",
        "en": "1. .url(...)"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "ApiClient zinciri başlatır: builder.url(\"/orders\"). Builder değeri saklar ve this döner; böylece bir sonraki çağrı aynı nesne üzerinde devam eder (fluent interface).",
        "en": "ApiClient starts the chain: builder.url(\"/orders\"). The builder stores the value and returns this, so the next call continues on the same object (fluent interface)."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "inherit": false,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "client",
          "builder"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "cl-b",
          "b-self"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "builder": {
          "status": "active",
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "url: /orders · headers: {} · timeout: 30000",
            "en": "url: /orders · headers: {} · timeout: 30000"
          }
        },
        "req": {
          "visible": false
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "cl-b",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "url(\"/orders\")",
          "durationMs": 900
        },
        {
          "edge": "b-self",
          "startAt": 1000,
          "shape": "dot",
          "label": "this",
          "durationMs": 700
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a1",
          "x": 480,
          "y": 150,
          "text": {
            "tr": "her adım isteğe bağlı, sırası serbest",
            "en": "every step optional, any order"
          },
          "target": "builder"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "header",
      "title": {
        "tr": "2. .header(...).timeout(...)",
        "en": "2. .header(...).timeout(...)"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "Zincir devam eder: header(\"Authorization\", token) ve timeout(5000). Telescoping constructor'daki new Request(url, null, null, 5000, null...) karmaşası yoktur; her parametre adıyla verilir.",
        "en": "The chain continues: header(\"Authorization\", token) and timeout(5000). No telescoping constructor mess like new Request(url, null, null, 5000, null...); every parameter is named."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "builder"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "cl-b"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "builder": {
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "url: /orders · headers: {Authorization} · timeout: 5000",
            "en": "url: /orders · headers: {Authorization} · timeout: 5000"
          }
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "cl-b",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "header(...)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "cl-b",
          "startAt": 900,
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "timeout(5000)",
          "durationMs": 800
        },
        {
          "edge": "b-self",
          "startAt": 1800,
          "shape": "dot",
          "label": "this",
          "durationMs": 600
        }
      ],
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "title": {
        "tr": "3. build(): doğrula ve üret",
        "en": "3. build(): validate and produce"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "build() zorunlu alanları tek yerde kontrol eder (url yoksa hata), varsayılanları uygular ve değişmez (readonly) bir HttpRequest yaratır. Yarım kurulmuş nesne hiçbir zaman dışarı sızmaz.",
        "en": "build() checks required fields in one place (error if url is missing), applies defaults and creates an immutable (readonly) HttpRequest. A half-built object never leaks out."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "builder",
          "req"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "b-req"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "req": {
          "visible": true,
          "status": "success",
          "badge": "immutable",
          "sublabel": {
            "tr": "GET /orders · 5000 ms",
            "en": "GET /orders · 5000 ms"
          }
        },
        "builder": {
          "badge": "validate ✓"
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "cl-b",
          "shape": "envelope",
          "label": "build()",
          "durationMs": 700
        },
        {
          "edge": "b-req",
          "startAt": 800,
          "shape": "square",
          "color": "accent",
          "label": "new HttpRequest(...)",
          "durationMs": 1000
        }
      ],
      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "a3",
          "x": 840,
          "y": 170,
          "text": {
            "tr": "doğrulama tek noktada: build()",
            "en": "validation in one place: build()"
          },
          "tone": "success",
          "target": "req"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "return",
      "title": {
        "tr": "4. Ürün istemciye döner",
        "en": "4. The product returns to the client"
      },
      "narration": {
        "tr": "ApiClient artık geçerli ve değişmez bir isteğe sahiptir. Builder yeniden kullanılabilir ya da atılabilir. Sık kurulumlar için bir \"director\" (RequestPresets.jsonGet) zinciri önceden hazırlar.",
        "en": "ApiClient now owns a valid, immutable request. The builder can be reused or discarded. For frequent setups a \"director\" (RequestPresets.jsonGet) pre-assembles the chain."
      },
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "highlight": {
        "nodes": [
          "client",
          "req"
        ],
        "edges": [
          "cl-b"
        ]
      },
      "nodeStates": {
        "builder": {
          "status": "idle",
          "badge": ""
        }
      },
      "edgeStates": {},
      "packets": [
        {
          "edge": "cl-b",
          "direction": "backward",
          "color": "success",
          "label": "HttpRequest",
          "durationMs": 900
        }
      ],
      "annotations": []
    }
  ],
  "loop": false,
  "defaultSpeed": 1,
  "tags": [
    "builder",
    "creational"
  ]
}
